      "id": "2080446507925577795",
      "text": "Just common sense",
      "created_at": "Fri Jul 24 00:14:34 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2080424736144937141",
        "text": "ELON MUSK: “My political views are very centrist. They’re not far right. Frankly, calling them far right is an insult to history and an insult to many people. It is an outrageous falsehood. It’s completely absurd. I have literally stated my position, and I’ve been very clear about this: there need to be secure borders.\n\nIf there’s an influx of immigrants, then they need to be people who agree with Western ideals and Western values. If there is long-term growth of people who do not, or in some cases are adamantly opposed to Western values, you are setting yourself up for civil war. This is obvious. A child can see this, but this is not a right wing view. I'm simply stating reality.”",
