        "id": "2080423253378744321",
        "text": "ELON MUSK: “I’m in favor of immigration. I’d be hypocritical if I wasn’t since I’m an immigrant to the United States. I’m in favor of immigration if the person immigrating is going to be a productive member of society, if they’re going to be honest, and if they’re not going to mistreat people in that country.”",
